# CONTOUR C1: the four bare filenames above came from an earlier wave's scratch cleanup, and a
# bare pattern matches at ANY DEPTH — so they silently swallow the ARCHIVED measurement runners
# under docs/measurements/. L3's had to be `git add -f`d; C1's `git add -A` dropped run_chunk.sh
# without a word, leaving both committed runners (which do `bash "$HERE/run_chunk.sh"`) inoperable.
# An archived runner is the provenance of every number in this repo. Un-ignore them explicitly.
!docs/measurements/**/run_chunk.sh
!docs/measurements/**/run_chunk0.sh
!docs/measurements/**/battery.sh
!docs/measurements/**/agg.py

# RESONANCE C1 (VOICE) verification artifacts — screenshots + measurement dumps, never committed
c1_*.png
*_balance.txt
qa*.txt

